    <h1>Mini Biography: Steve Jobs</h1>
    <p>Steve Jobs was an American entrepreneur, inventor, and the co-founder of Apple Inc.</p>
 
    <h2>Early Life</h2>
    <p>He grew up in California and loved electronics, design, and hacking gadgets together in his garage.</p>
    <p><small>Note: Students can replace this person with any personality they admire.</small></p>
 
    <h2>Important Achievement</h2>
    <p>He played a <strong>major role in inventing the iPhone and iPad</strong>.</p>
    <p>He is remembered as a <em>creative genius</em> who changed how we use technology.</p>
    <p>One value that made him special was <mark>perfectionism</mark>.</p>
 
    <h2>Correction Corner</h2>
    <p><s>He only made computers.</s> He also changed the music industry with the iPod and animated movies with Pixar.</p>
 
    <h2>Interesting Examples</h2>
    <p>He wanted to make a dent in the universe and help people reach the 1<sup>st</sup> class of innovation.</p>
    <p>He loved simple design, almost like the pure simplicity of a water molecule, H<sub>2</sub>O.</p>
 
    <h2>Words That Inspire</h2>
    <p>He once said, <q>Stay hungry, stay foolish.</q></p>
    <blockquote>
      Your time is limited, so don't waste it living someone else's life.
    </blockquote>
 
    <h3>My Reflection</h3>
    <p>I admire Steve Jobs because he showed that combining technology with art can change the entire world.</p>
 
